            <para id="para-00070"> </para>
          </problem>
          <solution id="sol-00016">
            <para id="para-00071">Compare your answer: Here is how to find the line of best fit.</para>
            <para id="para-00072">Enter the number of years and the mean time into your technology:</para>
            <table class="unnumbered os-raise-horizontaltable unnumbered" id="table-00006">
              <tgroup cols="11">
<tbody>
                  <row>
                    <entry>
                      <emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> </emphasis>
                    </entry>
                    <entry> 36 </entry>
                    <entry> 32 </entry>
                    <entry> 28 </entry>
                    <entry> 24 </entry>
                    <entry> 20 </entry>
                    <entry> 16 </entry>
                    <entry> 12 </entry>
                    <entry> 8 </entry>
                    <entry> 4 </entry>
                    <entry> 0 </entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                    <entry>
                      <emphasis> <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> </emphasis>
                    </entry>
                    <entry> 9.72 </entry>
                    <entry> 9.83 </entry>
                    <entry> 9.86 </entry>
                    <entry> 9.97 </entry>
                    <entry> 9.88 </entry>
                    <entry> 10.01 </entry>
                    <entry> 9.96 </entry>
                    <entry> 10.13 </entry>
                    <entry> 10.30 </entry>
                    <entry> 10.09 </entry>
                  </row>
                </tbody>
              </tgroup>
            </table>
            <para id="para-00073">Create a scatter plot and line of best fit.</para>
            <media alt="A scatter plot that shows the year on the x-axis and the mean time in seconds on the y-axis. The best fit line that is drawn decreases from left to right">
              <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_03_04_11_02.jpg" width="450"/>
            </media>

            <para id="para-00074">The equation of the line of best fit, using technology, is <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.01</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>10.2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
      </note>

      </section>
    </section>

